      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T00:23:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a small flash size savings to be had by setting the hwinfo_name to a fixed value based on the build info.  A run-time check that verifies probed device_id matches the build info device_id is useful so the user knows if they selected the wrong part.",
