      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T23:11:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL looks good to me as it matches what was implemented for the Chromium EC.\n\nBecause Zephyr EC flash size is still larger than the Chromium EC flash size, I see value in creating a follow up CL to return the chip vendor and name based on the build info.  Your proposal sounds good.",
